{%- doc -%}
  hCaptcha notice for forms Shopify protects with hCaptcha (newsletter and
  contact forms). Shopify pins an hCaptcha badge to the bottom-right corner
  once such a form is touched, where it covers the floating buttons; the
  theme hides that badge (layout/theme.liquid), and hCaptcha asks for this
  notice in the form instead.

  @param {string} [class] - Extra class for styling in the host form.

  @example
  {% render 'apgo-hcaptcha-note' %}
{%- enddoc -%}

<p class="apgo-hcaptcha-note{% if class != blank %} {{ class }}{% endif %}">
  本網站受 hCaptcha 保護，並適用 hCaptcha 的
  <a href="https://www.hcaptcha.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener">隱私權政策</a>與
  <a href="https://www.hcaptcha.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener">服務條款</a>。
</p>
